# Local override for Ubuntu's legacy uvcdynctrl rule.
#
# Intel RealSense D435i (8086:0b3a) does not use the legacy uvcdynctrl XML
# controls. On this machine libwebcam loops while enumerating its V4L2
# controls and grows /var/log/uvcdynctrl-udev.log by several GB per minute.
#
# This intentionally empty same-name override disables the obsolete packaged
# rule. It does not affect librealsense. Very old UVC webcams that rely on
# vendor extension XML files may lose those extra controls.
